msgid ""
"Write a recovery bundle (the selected backup, the restore helper, its "
"manifest and a README) to a removable USB device. A restore cannot run from "
"within OpenMediaVault because it overwrites the disk the system boots from. "
"Boot a live/rescue environment, open this device and run 'sudo ./omv-"
"restore-helper auto'."
msgstr ""

msgid "Write the selected backup to a removable recovery USB device."
msgstr ""

msgid "borgbackup"
msgstr "borgbackup"

msgid "dd"
msgstr "dd"

msgid ""
"dd - use dd to clone the OS partition to a compressed image file.<br />dd "
"full disk - use dd to clone the entire drive to a compressed image file.<br "
"/>fsarchiver - use fsarchiver to clone the OS partition to an archive "
"file<br />borgbackup - use borgbackup to backup system to an archive file<br"
" />rsync - use rsync to sync files to destination directory"
msgstr "dd - ໃຊ້ dd ເພື່ອໂຄລນພາທິຊັນ OS ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດ.<br />dd full disk - ໃຊ້ dd ເພື່ອໂຄລນດິດທັງໝົດໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ອິເມຈທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດ.<br />fsarchiver - ໃຊ້ fsarchiver ເພື່ອໂຄລນພາທິຊັນ OS ໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ<br />borgbackup - ໃຊ້ borgbackup ເພື່ອສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບ<br />rsync - ໃຊ້ rsync ເພື່ອຊິງຄ໌ໄຟລ໌ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີປາຍທາງ"

msgid "dd full disk"
msgstr "dd ທັງໝົດດິດ"

